      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"f22ab989-eab7-4739-84f8-a13cbd8bc8ee","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"249"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":0,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":753.0,"y":-176.0},"guid":"c2587110-a109-47c2-bbe0-79e2dfd5f26c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"3854"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":902.0,"y":-240.0},"guid":"1d8d3a14-9787-4891-a4f3-bca3eb9021bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3856"},{"argumentCount":0,"coroutine":false,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"PlayerNextTrick","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-452.0,"y":-1778.0},"guid":"68cec2e4-ce27-4752-b40a-9e52f7f0ef3c","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"3858"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":709.0,"y":-1696.0},"guid":"45015fbe-50fe-4308-bb91-ea6e09538915","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"3860"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Players","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":2034.0,"y":773.0},"guid":"76189802-aea5-4a87-902b-71db2c4959c6","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"3862"},{"chainable":false,"parameterNames":["name"],"member":{"name":"Find","parameterTypes":["System.String"],"targetType":"UnityEngine.GameObject","targetTypeName":"UnityEngine.GameObject","$version":"A"},"defaultValues":{"%name":{"$content":"PlayerHuman","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":-1673.0,"y":692.0},"guid":"cc42bff5-edd5-4d98-92d7-20e7701ece54","$version":"A","$typ