      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\nRESET
      LEADING COLOR : how ?\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":834.0,"y":416.0},"guid":"9a9722d5-4e09-4a50-8e0d-75dd39cc9aac","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SubgraphUnit","$id":"3883"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"trumpColor","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":3751.0,"y":815.0},"guid":"9ef66985-b0c4-43e5-a842-80e7818a281b","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"7488"},{"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":583.0,"y":271.0},"guid":"292374a0-066a-4322-ba68-cf3f455d1f68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.If","$id":"7490"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":9.0,"y":-482.0},"guid":"20ddcb13-1bf5-4832-9726-1d40ac80ff36","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"7492"},{"numeric":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":3939.0,"y":847.0},"guid":"29f83803-1b5b-4a48-aa9b-1e6709d03c25","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Equal","$id":"7494"},{"SnapToGrid":false,"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":1652.0,"y":667.0},"guid":"648a31eb-62c2-4426-a82b-e89d07759ded","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Community.FlowReroute","$id":"7496"},{"type":"System.Int32","value":{"$content":1,"$type":"System.Int32"},"defaultValues":{},"position":{"x":588.0,"y":-1008.0},"guid":"7d1b00f9-1634-4b15-a6d5-be8cae89a7b7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.Literal","$id":"7498"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":710.0,"y":-912.0},"guid":"090c952b-73ba-40ca-aff8-66f2cea408dd","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SetVariable","$id":"7500"},{"kind":"Scene","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"CurrentPlayer","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":900.0,"y":-424.0},"guid":"7653cf62-f2d5-4a81-865e-0e3150880fc0","$ve